WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.937
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:01.207 --> 00:02.680
Hey...

3
00:07.915 --> 00:10.060
I can say this now, but...

4
00:13.214 --> 00:14.587
I...

5
00:17.987 --> 00:19.991
I really...

6
00:21.840 --> 00:23.620
respect you.

7
00:25.073 --> 00:26.702
You respect me?

8
00:27.956 --> 00:31.884
Like how you came back even though you had plans.

9
00:31.884 --> 00:35.108
Well, that's because I'm also part of the team.

10
00:35.108 --> 00:37.715
You stick to your ideals,

11
00:37.715 --> 00:41.294
regardless of how it looks to others.

12
00:41.294 --> 00:44.484
You're able to take action for other people.

13
00:46.720 --> 00:48.808
I respect that.

14
00:51.182 --> 00:52.657
Do you really?

15
00:52.657 --> 00:54.090
I do.

16
00:55.896 --> 00:57.371
Well...

17
00:58.140 --> 01:00.110
Thank you.

18
01:00.110 --> 01:01.530
Not at all.

19
01:04.823 --> 01:07.624
Hey, about this page here...

20
01:07.624 --> 01:10.663
Did the last point person share it?

21
01:10.663 --> 01:13.156
Probably not yet.

22
01:30.167 --> 01:33.872
[Sorry for leaving so suddenly today. I'm done with work.]

23
01:37.577 --> 01:39.434
I'm sorry, Ryosuke.

24
01:39.434 --> 01:41.828
Can I head back to the office?

25
01:42.849 --> 01:44.082
Huh?

26
01:44.991 --> 01:49.828
I don't want to leave Kashiwagi to do everything on his own.

27
01:51.303 --> 01:54.743
Sorry. I know we had plans...

28
02:01.636 --> 02:02.887
Sure.

29
02:04.276 --> 02:06.258
I'm fine with it.

30
02:07.404 --> 02:08.924
Do your best.

31
02:10.631 --> 02:12.371
Thank you.

32
02:34.667 --> 02:42.699
[Glad to hear that. Rest well!]

33
03:39.610 --> 03:44.558
Mr. Taguchi, regarding the test results...

34
03:44.558 --> 03:46.310
I'll send the documents.

35
03:46.310 --> 03:48.259
Thank you so much.

36
03:53.483 --> 03:55.584
Good work yesterday.

37
03:56.350 --> 04:00.240
Thank you. But I'm really sorry.

38
04:00.240 --> 04:03.755
No worries. It's work. It can't be helped.

39
04:06.216 --> 04:07.429
Okay.

40
04:08.976 --> 04:11.495
Really, don't worry about it.

41
04:18.592 --> 04:20.519
Hey, Ryosuke!

42
04:24.381 --> 04:28.329
The get-together is today, right?

43
04:33.750 --> 04:35.263
Yes, it is.

44
04:58.524 --> 05:00.471
Ms. Yamane.

45
05:00.471 --> 05:01.884
Yes?

46
05:01.884 --> 05:04.788
Shall we get ready for the get-together?

47
05:04.788 --> 05:06.448
Got it.

48
05:15.696 --> 05:17.029
So?

49
05:18.229 --> 05:19.456
Well?

50
05:20.167 --> 05:22.258
Did something happen with him?

51
05:24.366 --> 05:27.323
I have time to talk now if you want.

52
05:31.143 --> 05:33.010
Well...

53
05:35.817 --> 05:40.449
"Don't worry about it", huh?

54
05:41.349 --> 05:46.311
I feel like he's not telling me how he really feels.

55
05:50.055 --> 05:53.085
I don't want to force it out of him.

56
05:54.272 --> 05:56.724
Did you tell her the truth?

57
05:56.724 --> 05:58.925
I didn't tell her...

58
06:00.576 --> 06:02.251
and I don't want to.

59
06:02.251 --> 06:03.918
Huh?

60
06:04.671 --> 06:07.050
I don't want to trouble her.

61
06:18.402 --> 06:22.850
What if you hug him tight and comfort him?

62
06:24.484 --> 06:26.439
Hug him tight?

63
06:26.439 --> 06:31.950
I mean... A tight hug, then gentle pats.

64
06:37.431 --> 06:42.788
It's easier to speak your true feelings if you feel loved.

65
06:48.700 --> 06:50.622
I see.

66
06:57.276 --> 06:59.152
- Hug. - Hug.

67
06:59.985 --> 07:01.805
Pat, pat.

68
07:01.805 --> 07:03.820
Pat, pat.

69
07:05.248 --> 07:07.719
Horizontal? No, vertical.

70
07:07.719 --> 07:09.449
Like this.

71
07:09.449 --> 07:14.834
So, our project has more members, and we can see new phases ahead.

72
07:14.834 --> 07:17.163
Let's keep pushing forward from here.

73
07:17.163 --> 07:18.199
Cheers!

74
07:18.199 --> 07:20.586
Cheers!

75
07:31.055 --> 07:33.209
Mr. Taguchi, you live in the city, right?

76
07:33.209 --> 07:34.567
Yes, that's right.

77
07:34.567 --> 07:35.817
- Wow. - Good work.

78
07:35.817 --> 07:37.901
Isn't commuting every day tough?

79
07:37.901 --> 07:41.730
Not really. It's only about an hour.

80
07:46.213 --> 07:47.999
Ms. Yamane.

81
07:47.999 --> 07:49.312
Yes?

82
07:49.966 --> 07:52.972
I heard you were classmates with Kashiwagi?

83
07:52.972 --> 07:54.752
That's correct.

84
07:55.600 --> 07:57.560
Were you close?

85
07:57.560 --> 08:01.227
Well, we were on committees together.

86
08:01.227 --> 08:04.776
And now you happen to work together.

87
08:04.776 --> 08:08.572
It feels like fate, doesn't it?

88
08:08.572 --> 08:11.947
Did you date before?

89
08:11.947 --> 08:13.627
No, I didn't.

90
08:14.465 --> 08:16.379
I didn't have any luck.

91
08:16.379 --> 08:20.372
Really? But you're so outgoing, you must have been popular!

92
08:20.372 --> 08:22.083
I think so too.

93
08:22.083 --> 08:24.798
You two should go on a date together.

94
08:24.798 --> 08:27.484
Mr. Yamamoto, that's enough.

95
08:27.484 --> 08:29.071
I'll give you a red card.

96
08:29.071 --> 08:32.991
- What? - Yeah, Ms. Yamane is uncomfortable.

97
08:57.620 --> 08:59.799
Hello, it's Taguchi.

98
08:59.799 --> 09:02.926
Hello. Can you talk now?

99
09:02.926 --> 09:05.359
Yes, it's fine.

100
09:06.294 --> 09:10.216
You see, the client insists strongly.

101
09:11.251 --> 09:15.908
I feel bad asking you to step away from your current work, but...

102
09:23.856 --> 09:25.682
Ryosuke.

103
09:28.985 --> 09:31.645
I figured you'd be here.

104
09:33.391 --> 09:34.818
I see.

105
10:04.321 --> 10:05.580
Huh?

106
10:06.899 --> 10:11.576
It's... a way to show affection.

107
10:12.740 --> 10:15.014
Sorry, I took you by surprise.

108
10:17.829 --> 10:19.302
It's fine.

109
10:23.451 --> 10:26.963
Are you free on your next day off?

110
10:26.963 --> 10:30.873
I was hoping we could spend some quiet time together.

111
10:32.844 --> 10:34.291
Oh...

112
10:35.747 --> 10:40.282
Things have been really busy lately.

113
10:42.629 --> 10:44.177
I see.

114
10:45.080 --> 10:46.815
That's totally fine.

115
10:54.612 --> 10:56.133
Okay, then.

116
10:56.917 --> 10:58.552
I'll reach out again.

117
10:59.851 --> 11:01.151
Okay.

118
11:17.183 --> 11:20.069
What's your class doing?

119
11:20.789 --> 11:22.216
A haunted house.

120
11:22.216 --> 11:23.789
Wow, that sounds fun.

121
11:23.789 --> 11:25.954
- She's close with Taguchi. - Ours is a planetarium.

122
11:25.954 --> 11:28.324
But she seems so gentle.

123
11:29.507 --> 11:31.098
You're too loud.

124
11:32.131 --> 11:34.022
Come over when it's open.

125
11:34.022 --> 11:36.652
I'll go check out your class too.

126
11:38.165 --> 11:39.966
- What was that? - Is it a fight?

127
11:39.966 --> 11:41.757
Oh, man!

128
11:45.873 --> 11:47.533
Taguchi.

129
11:55.343 --> 11:56.916
What's wrong?

130
12:00.561 --> 12:03.401
Hey! What are you guys doing?

131
12:03.401 --> 12:05.548
Where are you going?

132
12:24.603 --> 12:27.876
Two is greater than zero.

133
12:27.876 --> 12:33.806
That means this parabola opens upwards.

134
12:33.806 --> 12:39.500
And a parabola opening upwards extends forever upward,

135
12:39.500 --> 12:42.452
so it has a minimum point.

136
13:03.283 --> 13:04.856
Taguchi.

137
13:08.490 --> 13:11.809
Are you all right from earlier?

138
13:22.186 --> 13:24.159
I heard there are rumors.

139
13:25.357 --> 13:26.657
Huh?

140
13:28.127 --> 13:32.388
That I'm forcing you to be with me.

141
13:38.072 --> 13:39.785
It's annoying.

142
13:47.367 --> 13:49.415
But...

143
13:51.840 --> 13:56.465
Those rumors will die down soon.

144
13:58.975 --> 14:05.775
I want to keep hanging out with you, Taguchi.

145
14:07.086 --> 14:08.399
Those rumors aren't...

146
14:08.399 --> 14:10.366
It bothers me!

147
14:20.359 --> 14:22.540
Don't talk to me anymore.

148
14:29.948 --> 14:32.636
You can easily make other friends.

149
14:37.269 --> 14:38.822
See you.

150
14:48.304 --> 14:51.862
Okay, let's proceed with this plan.

151
14:51.862 --> 14:53.724
- Got it. - Okay.

152
14:56.169 --> 14:59.574
Oh, by the way, it's a bit sudden,

153
14:59.574 --> 15:03.063
but Mr. Taguchi is leaving the project.

154
15:03.063 --> 15:05.116
What?

155
15:05.116 --> 15:08.006
Our client apparently has their reasons.

156
15:09.098 --> 15:12.434
Sorry, could you handle the paperwork?

157
15:13.858 --> 15:15.178
Okay.

158
15:37.401 --> 15:39.202
Hey.

159
15:43.191 --> 15:44.678
Hey.

160
15:50.851 --> 15:55.370
I heard you're moving to a new company next week.

161
16:02.830 --> 16:04.223
Yeah.

162
16:08.657 --> 16:10.816
That must be tough.

163
16:12.267 --> 16:16.042
I feel like you have to learn so much.

164
16:18.205 --> 16:19.888
Well...

165
16:21.460 --> 16:23.202
Yeah, I guess.

166
16:29.148 --> 16:30.815
Hey.

167
16:33.460 --> 16:35.284
This transfer...

168
16:36.209 --> 16:38.656
It was decided suddenly, right?

169
16:45.550 --> 16:46.983
I'm sorry.

170
17:01.597 --> 17:03.858
Ryosuke,

171
17:05.449 --> 17:11.236
you always value how I feel.

172
17:14.362 --> 17:19.051
You always worry about whether I'm upset.

173
17:19.663 --> 17:22.258
And you're so considerate.

174
17:27.005 --> 17:31.584
But I'm not sure if you're being honest

175
17:31.584 --> 17:35.613
about your own feelings.

176
17:36.552 --> 17:38.442
I'm worried.

177
17:45.584 --> 17:47.249
I...

178
17:48.314 --> 17:54.435
want to be someone you can talk honestly to

179
17:54.435 --> 17:56.515
about this stuff.

180
17:58.854 --> 18:00.779
Even if...

181
18:01.617 --> 18:05.244
I'm not dependable enough.

182
18:15.341 --> 18:16.676
Yeah.

183
18:19.673 --> 18:21.159
Thank you.

184
18:27.065 --> 18:28.526
But...

185
18:33.299 --> 18:36.236
You don't need to worry about anything.

186
18:46.208 --> 18:47.293
What?

187
18:47.293 --> 18:50.632
You made her say all that and then ran away? That's embarrassing.

188
18:50.632 --> 18:52.205
Shut up.

189
18:53.941 --> 18:57.631
Just tell her everything already.

190
18:57.631 --> 19:00.699
You're just making things messier by hiding it.

191
19:01.908 --> 19:03.617
I know, but...

192
19:06.338 --> 19:09.948
Get a grip! You're dating her!

193
19:19.695 --> 19:22.183
Putting distance between you again...

194
19:22.866 --> 19:25.499
Are you gonna regret it for years again?

195
19:35.657 --> 19:37.810
I want to see Yamane.

196
19:40.554 --> 19:44.680
Okay, okay. Just have some water.

197
19:45.606 --> 19:47.661
I really miss her.

198
19:51.646 --> 19:53.735
What about a class reunion?

199
19:54.361 --> 19:56.694
I'd never get invited.

200
19:58.615 --> 20:00.779
Find her on social media.

201
20:05.375 --> 20:07.108
You looked her up, huh?

202
20:07.755 --> 20:09.501
I couldn't find her.

203
20:09.501 --> 20:12.914
Ew, creepy.

204
20:12.914 --> 20:15.505
Shut up.

205
20:18.188 --> 20:23.288
It's not like you'll never see her again.

206
20:23.921 --> 20:25.980
So work on yourself instead.

207
20:36.553 --> 20:38.300
Don't fall asleep.

208
20:48.534 --> 20:50.548
When Shiori...

209
20:53.962 --> 20:56.754
and I make eye contact,

210
20:57.453 --> 21:00.668
I love that smile she gives me.

211
21:03.852 --> 21:09.543
I worry a little when she falls asleep right after drinking, though...

212
21:10.636 --> 21:13.451
But I love that side too.

213
21:17.572 --> 21:20.142
I love it when she calls my name.

214
21:23.971 --> 21:27.291
I love how unexpectedly bold she is.

215
21:35.004 --> 21:38.450
I could go on forever about all the things I like.

216
21:49.008 --> 21:51.096
I want to be with her forever.

217
21:54.415 --> 21:57.451
Tell her that. Say it to her face.

218
21:58.773 --> 22:01.164
Stop trying to act cool.

219
23:07.366 --> 23:10.639
In the end, we never got to talk it through properly.

220
23:21.386 --> 23:23.687
Ryosuke, once again...

221
23:25.599 --> 23:27.789
disappeared.

222
23:30.327 --> 23:33.327
Are things going well with Yamane?

223
23:33.327 --> 23:34.988
I want you to give this back.

224
23:34.988 --> 23:37.581
I'll be waiting to hear about it.

225
23:37.581 --> 23:40.067
I wanted to protect Shiori.

226
23:40.067 --> 23:43.663
Did I do something to make him hate me?

227
23:43.663 --> 23:48.670
Maybe it'd be good for you two to trust yourselves.

228
23:49.326 --> 23:51.012
Ryosuke.

229
23:51.012 --> 23:53.619
I'm sorry. I'm so pathetic.

230
23:53.619 --> 23:56.260
It's okay to show that side of you.

231
23:56.260 --> 24:00.673
I'm so glad we got to meet again.
